# NAME: Spotify Audio (Direct)
# 作用: 拦截所有大流量音频数据与流媒体分发节点走直连

# 1. Akamaized 音频流与握手切片
DOMAIN,audio4-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,heads-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio4-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads4-ak-spotify-com.akamaized.net

# 2. pscdn 核心音频流池 (大流量音频主源)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pscdn.co

# 3. spotifycdn.com 专有音频流子域名 (包含刚才拦截失败的 audio-ak)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ak.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio4-ak.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-fa.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio4-fa.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads-ak.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads4-ak.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads-fa.spotifycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads4-fa.spotifycdn.com

# 4. scdn.co 专有音频流子域名
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ak.scdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-fa.scdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads-ak.scdn.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,heads-fa.scdn.co
